        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana GB42U32D 42 Inch Stainless Steel Grab Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n42\" stainless steel grab bar with a brushed stainless steel finish. These are most often used in the bathrooms near the tub and toilet but they are perfect for anywhere ADA compliant grab bars are required.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-GB42U32D_size.gif?v=1704354751\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana GB42U32D 42 Inch Stainless Steel Grab Bar\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/42-inch-stainless-steel-ada-compliant-3-post-grab-bar-deltana-gb42cpu32d\"><b>42 Inch Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Grab Bar</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/36-inch-stainless-steel-ada-compliant-grab-bar-deltana-gb36u32d\"><b>36 Inch Stainless Steel Grab Bar</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/30-inch-stainless-steel-ada-compliant-grab-bar-deltana-gb30u32d\"><b>30 Inch Stainless Steel Grab Bar</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/24-inch-stainless-steel-ada-compliant-grab-bar-deltana-gb24u32d\"><b>24 Inch Stainless Steel Grab Bar</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/18-inch-stainless-steel-ada-compliant-grab-bar-deltana-gb18u32d\"><b>18 Inch Stainless Steel Grab Bar</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDesigned to exceed 250 lbs of load force when properly installed into wall studs. Concealed screw mounting for a clean installation. Packaged with six (6) #12 x 2-1/2\" stainless steel screws and plastic anchors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Deltana GB42U32D 42 Inch Stainless Steel Grab Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>US32D Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Length, Center to Center Mounting: 42\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 45-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Tube Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GB42U32D.pdf?v=1704262296\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana GB42U32D Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
